{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60004","type":"group","x":-2000,"y":-500,"width":3700,"height":900,"color":"4","label":"4. Middleware Pipeline + Plugins"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60007","type":"group","x":-2000,"y":1300,"width":3700,"height":700,"color":"1","label":"7. Tests, Tooling & Infrastructure"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60005","type":"group","x":-2000,"y":500,"width":2200,"height":700,"color":"5","label":"5. Proxy Engine (Undici)"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60006","type":"group","x":300,"y":500,"width":1400,"height":700,"color":"6","label":"6. Cross-cutting (Logger & Errors)"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60002","type":"group","x":-800,"y":-1200,"width":1300,"height":600,"color":"2","label":"2. Configuration (Hot Reload)"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60001","type":"group","x":-2000,"y":-1200,"width":1100,"height":600,"color":"1","label":"1. Bootstrap"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60003","type":"group","x":600,"y":-1200,"width":1100,"height":600,"color":"3","label":"3. Server & Routing"},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5000001","type":"text","text":"# API Gateway — Mapa Conceptual\n\n**TypeScript · Fastify · Undici · Redis · Pino · Prometheus**\n\nReverse proxy modular con pipeline de middlewares, rate-limiting con Redis,\nautenticación JWT, circuit breakers, métricas Prometheus y hot-reload de configuración sin downtime vía `SIGHUP`.","x":-1600,"y":-1600,"width":3200,"height":320,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5000002","type":"text","text":"## src/index.ts\n\n**Bootstrap sequence:**\n\n1. `loadConfig()` — valida YAML+Zod\n2. Init Pino logger\n3. Conecta a Redis (3 reintentos, fast-fail)\n4. Construye `RouteRegistry` + `ConfigSnapshot`\n5. Instancia plugins (rate-limit, jwt, circuit-breaker, metrics)\n6. Construye `MiddlewarePipeline`\n7. `buildServer()` — Fastify factory\n8. Wire `ConfigReloader` (SIGHUP)\n9. `server.listen({ port, host })`\n\n**Graceful shutdown** (`SIGTERM`/`SIGINT`):\n- `server.close()`\n- Cierra Undici pools\n- `redis.quit()`","x":-1900,"y":-1100,"width":900,"height":460},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5000003","type":"text","text":"## src/config/\n\n**`loader.ts`** — `loadConfig()` lee `gateway.yaml` con interpolación `${VAR}`.\n\n**`schema.ts`** — Validación Zod del YAML.\n\n**`types.ts`** — Tipos de `Route`, `Override`, `ConfigSnapshot`.\n\n**`reloader.ts`** — `ConfigReloader` escucha SIGHUP, valida nueva config y **swap atómico** de snapshot (mutex evita reloads concurrentes).\n\n### Hot Reload (SIGHUP)\n- **Reloadable:** `routes[].rateLimit`, `overrides`, `logging.level`\n- **Requiere restart:** `server.*`, `redis.*`, `routes[].prefix/target/stripPrefix/timeout`, add/remove routes\n- **Rollback automático** si el YAML/Zod falla validación","x":-700,"y":-1100,"width":1200,"height":460},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5000004","type":"text","text":"## src/server.ts + src/routing/\n\n**Fastify factory** registra:\n- Hook `onRequest` global → adjunta `routeMatch` al `request.gatewayContext`\n- Endpoint `/metrics` (si `metrics.enabled`)\n- Cada ruta como `${prefix}*` con `preHandler: pipeline.getPreHandler()`\n\n**`routing/registry.ts`** — `RouteRegistry.match(url)`:\n- **Prioridad:** `overrides[].path` (exacto) > `routes[].prefix` (longest prefix)\n- Retorna `RouteMatch` con: target, stripPrefix, rateLimit, timeout, circuitBreaker, metricsLabel","x":700,"y":-1100,"width":900,"height":460},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5000005","type":"text","text":"## src/middleware/pipeline.ts\n\n```typescript\ninterface GatewayPlugin {\n  name: string;\n  onRequest?(ctx: RequestContext): Promise<void>;\n  onResponse?(ctx: ResponseContext): Promise<void>;\n  getLifecycleHooks?(): ProxyLifecycleHooks;\n}\n```\n\n- `MiddlewarePipeline` corre hooks **secuencialmente**\n- **Short-circuit:** si un hook llama `reply.send()` → para todo, el proxy NO se invoca\n- Expone `getPreHandler()` y `getLifecycleHooks()` para integración con el proxy\n\n**Orden importa:** plugins tempranos corren primero en request, último en response.","x":-1900,"y":-400,"width":1300,"height":760},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5000007","type":"text","text":"## JWT Auth\n\n**`src/middleware/jwt-auth/`**\n\n- Validación con `jose` (HS256 / RS256)\n- Hook `onRequest` valida `Authorization: Bearer <token>`\n- Falla → 401 (short-circuit)\n- Claims expuestos vía `request.gatewayContext.jwt`","x":400,"y":-400,"width":800,"height":360},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5000008","type":"text","text":"## Circuit Breaker + Retry\n\n**`src/middleware/circuit-breaker/`**\n\n### State machine (`state.ts`)\n`CLOSED` → `OPEN` (umbral o 5 fallos seguidos) → `HALF_OPEN` (tras `recoveryTimeMs`) → `CLOSED` (tras `halfOpenRequests` éxitos) | `OPEN` (cualquier fallo)\n\n### Retry (`retry.ts`)\n- **Idempotentes:** GET, HEAD, OPTIONS, PUT, DELETE\n- **Errores:** `ECONNREFUSED`, `ETIMEDOUT`, `ECONNRESET`, `ENOTFOUND`, `EPIPE` o HTTP 5xx\n- Backoff exponencial + full jitter\n- **Nunca** reintenta si el circuit está `OPEN`\n\n### Métricas + plugin wiring\nSe integra al proxy vía `getLifecycleHooks()` con `onBeforeRequest` / `onAfterResponse` / `onError`.","x":1250,"y":-400,"width":1100,"height":760},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5000009","type":"text","text":"## Metrics (Prometheus)\n\n**`src/middleware/metrics/`**\n\n- `prom-client` collectors\n- Endpoint `/metrics` (path configurable)\n- Métricas: `gateway_http_*`, `gateway_rate_limit_*`, `gateway_circuit_breaker_*`, `gateway_retries_*`\n- **Low-cardinality labels:** `metricsLabel` y `backendName` como fallbacks\n- `gateway_http_requests_in_flight` usa `Symbol` privado + `socket.once('close')` para evitar doble-decremento en abortos","x":2400,"y":-400,"width":1100,"height":360},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5000010","type":"text","text":"## src/proxy/engine.ts\n\n`ProxyEngine.forward()`:\n- Ejecuta request upstream con Undici\n- **Pipe bidireccional** del body\n- Aplica headers `X-Forwarded-*` (for, host, proto)\n\n## src/proxy/pool.ts\n`ConnectionPoolManager` — **1 pool de Undici por target backend** (reutilización de conexiones).\n\n## src/proxy/headers.ts\nConstrucción de headers de forwarding.","x":-1900,"y":600,"width":1100,"height":560},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5000011","type":"text","text":"## src/proxy/hooks.ts + types.ts\n\n```typescript\ninterface ProxyLifecycleHooks {\n  onBeforeRequest?(ctx): void;\n  onAfterResponse?(ctx): void;\n  onError?(ctx, err): void;\n}\n```\n\n**Plugins que se integran aquí:**\n- Circuit Breaker (consulta/actualiza state machine)\n- Metrics (contabiliza latencia, status, retries)\n\nPermite interceptar el ciclo de vida **interno** del proxy, no solo a nivel HTTP request/response.","x":-750,"y":600,"width":900,"height":560},
		{"id":"b1c2d4e4f5000016","type":"text","text":"## docker/ + dev stack (docker-compose.example.yml)\n\n| Servicio     | Puerto local | Propósito                                |\n|--------------|--------------|------------------------------------------|\n| `gateway-service` | 8080     | Imagen del gateway (Node 20+)            |\n| `redis`      | 6379         | Store de rate-limit (ioredis)            |\n| `mock-backend` | 3000       | Backend dummy para tests E2E             |\n| `dozzle`     | 9999         | Live tail de logs (sin login)            |\n| `prometheus` | 9090         | Scrape `/metrics` cada 15s               |\n| `grafana`    | 3001         | Dashboard \"Gateway Overview\" pre-cargado |\n\n### Hot reload en contenedor\n```bash\ndocker kill -s SIGHUP gateway-service\n```\n\n### Config\n- `config/gateway.yaml` (override con `CONFIG_PATH`)\n- `config/gateway-schema.json` (autocomplete VS Code + Red Hat YAML)","x":-550,"y":1400,"width":2200,"height":560},
		{"id":"b1c2d4e4f5000017","type":"text","text":"## Quick reference\n\n### Comandos clave\n```bash\npnpm install\npnpm dev          # tsx watch\npnpm build        # → dist/\npnpm start        # prod\npnpm test         # vitest\npnpm lint         # eslint\npnpm format       # prettier\npnpm docker:build\n```\n\n### Configuración (top-level)\n- `server.{port,host}`\n- `redis.{url,onFailure}`\n- `logging.level` *(hot)*\n- `metrics.{enabled,path,defaultLabels}`\n- `routes[]` *(prefix, target, stripPrefix, rateLimit, timeout, circuitBreaker, metricsLabel, backendName)*\n- `overrides[]` *(path, rateLimit)* *(hot)*","x":1700,"y":1400,"width":800,"height":560},
		{"id":"b1c2d3e4f5000006","type":"text","text":"## Rate Limit (Redis)\n\n**`src/middleware/rate-limit/`**\n\n- `store.ts` + `window.ts` — contador fixed-window con ioredis pipeline (atómico)\n- `plugin.ts` — hook `onRequest`\n- `fail-open` deja pasar · `fail-closed` responde 503 ante error de Redis\n- Configurable por ruta: `routes[].rateLimit.windowMs/max`\n- Override exacto: `overrides[].rateLimit`","x":-550,"y":-400,"width":900,"height":360},
		{"id":"b1c2d4e4f5000012","type":"text","text":"## src/logger/\n\n**Pino** con serializers:\n\n- Redacta `Authorization` y `Cookie` headers\n- Output JSON estructurado\n- `logging.level` es **hot-reloadable**\n- Logger inyectado en cada módulo","x":400,"y":600,"width":600,"height":280},
		{"id":"b1c2d4e4f5000013","type":"text","text":"## src/errors/\n\n**Global error handler:**\n\n- 5xx → envelope JSON sanitizado\n- Stack traces **NUNCA** expuestos al cliente\n- IPs internas **NUNCA** expuestas\n- Mapea errores de plugins/Zod/Undici a respuestas HTTP consistentes","x":1050,"y":600,"width":600,"height":280},
		{"id":"b1c2d4e4f5000014","type":"text","text":"## Request lifecycle (end-to-end)\n\n```\nClient\n  → Fastify onRequest (match route)\n  → pipeline.onRequest [rate-limit → jwt → circuit-breaker → metrics]\n  → ProxyEngine.forward (Undici pool)\n      ↳ hooks.onBeforeRequest / onError / onAfterResponse\n  → Upstream backend\n  → response streamed back\n  → pipeline.onResponse (reverse order)\n```","x":400,"y":920,"width":600,"height":240},
		{"id":"b1c2d4e4f5000015","type":"text","text":"## tests/\n\n### Unit (rápidos, sin red)\n- `tests/unit/config/` — loader, schema, reloader\n- `tests/unit/errors/` — error handler\n- `tests/unit/middleware/` — pipeline, plugins\n- `tests/unit/proxy/` — engine, pool, headers\n- `tests/unit/routing/` — matcher, registry\n\n### Integration (con Redis y HTTP real)\n- `tests/integration/proxy/`\n- `tests/integration/rate-limit/`\n- `tests/integration/jwt-auth/`\n- `tests/integration/circuit-breaker/`\n- `tests/integration/hot-reload/` (verifica SIGHUP end-to-end)\n\n**Runner:** Vitest. Comandos: `pnpm test`, `pnpm test:unit`, `pnpm test:integration`, `pnpm test:coverage`.","x":-1900,"y":1400,"width":1300,"height":560},
		{"id":"0ad146aaa0da51d8","type":"text","text":"## tests/\n\n### Unit (rápidos, sin red)\n- `tests/unit/config/` — loader, schema, reloader\n- `tests/unit/errors/` — error handler\n- `tests/unit/middleware/` — pipeline, plugins\n- `tests/unit/proxy/` — engine, pool, headers\n- `tests/unit/routing/` — matcher, registry\n\n### Integration (con Redis y HTTP real)\n- `tests/integration/proxy/`\n- `tests/integration/rate-limit/`\n- `tests/integration/jwt-auth/`\n- `tests/integration/circuit-breaker/`\n- `tests/integration/hot-reload/` (verifica SIGHUP end-to-end)\n\n**Runner:** Vitest. Comandos: `pnpm test`, `pnpm test:unit`, `pnpm test:integration`, `pnpm test:coverage`.","x":-1940,"y":1400,"width":1300,"height":560},
		{"id":"2e78604b092c4a30","type":"text","text":"## tests/\n\n### Unit (rápidos, sin red)\n- `tests/unit/config/` — loader, schema, reloader\n- `tests/unit/errors/` — error handler\n- `tests/unit/middleware/` — pipeline, plugins\n- `tests/unit/proxy/` — engine, pool, headers\n- `tests/unit/routing/` — matcher, registry\n\n### Integration (con Redis y HTTP real)\n- `tests/integration/proxy/`\n- `tests/integration/rate-limit/`\n- `tests/integration/jwt-auth/`\n- `tests/integration/circuit-breaker/`\n- `tests/integration/hot-reload/` (verifica SIGHUP end-to-end)\n\n**Runner:** Vitest. Comandos: `pnpm test`, `pnpm test:unit`, `pnpm test:integration`, `pnpm test:coverage`.","x":-1920,"y":1400,"width":1300,"height":560},
		{"id":"e86226b0cbce2957","type":"text","text":"## tests/\n\n### Unit (rápidos, sin red)\n- `tests/unit/config/` — loader, schema, reloader\n- `tests/unit/errors/` — error handler\n- `tests/unit/middleware/` — pipeline, plugins\n- `tests/unit/proxy/` — engine, pool, headers\n- `tests/unit/routing/` — matcher, registry\n\n### Integration (con Redis y HTTP real)\n- `tests/integration/proxy/`\n- `tests/integration/rate-limit/`\n- `tests/integration/jwt-auth/`\n- `tests/integration/circuit-breaker/`\n- `tests/integration/hot-reload/` (verifica SIGHUP end-to-end)\n\n**Runner:** Vitest. Comandos: `pnpm test`, `pnpm test:unit`, `pnpm test:integration`, `pnpm test:coverage`.","x":-1940,"y":1400,"width":1300,"height":560}
	],
